{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S03、S07、S13的感受提示略显密集，部分意象连续堆叠，容易让观众来不及消化；Y在这些地方反而有些简洁感。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X把叙事拆成了容易捕捉的短句，并用重点加亮让观众迅速知道每段在讲什么，感受提示又能随音乐出现，不必一开始就面对一大堆短词。它对人物心理变化的因果关系交代得比较清楚，从离开后的失落、怀念与后悔，到重新认识孤独、接受矛盾，再到带着想念继续生活，前后形成了完整的心理过程。尤其是X的感受描写更具体，既有身体反应，也有音色、节奏、力度和音乐形态的变化，能让普通观众获得比笼统情绪标签更细腻的体验。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "762f96ad-9fa7-43eb-b550-f577a9713a97", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T193924705361Z", "elapsed_seconds": 40.422, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T19:40:05.143774+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "bc3b8083682d2351f1be0e75cef4149a44be9af56f1044ebdd3c9e07d85139ae", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", 